// Config of the workflow tests on the synthetic data (tests/pipeline.synthetic.nf.test).
// The synthetic tree (made by SyntheticTree.materialize in ${projectDir}/.nf-test/synthetic_root) is mounted into the task containers at the
// SAME path, because the artifacts that LOCATE_SCRNA_ARTIFACTS writes hold absolute paths that the head job reads on the host too.
// It replaces the credentials mount of the docker profile: nothing here reads gs://.
process.containerOptions = "-v ${projectDir}/.nf-test/synthetic_root:${projectDir}/.nf-test/synthetic_root:ro"
